# field
blog/templates/detail_page.html:1:13: DetailPage.Post has no field or method "Titel"
  fix: did you mean "Title"?
  see: maago doc template

# in range
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:20: an element of ListPage.Posts has no field or method "Titel"
  fix: did you mean "Title"?
  see: maago doc template

# $ is the page
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:21: ListPage has no field or method "Cont"
  fix: did you mean "Count"?
  see: maago doc template

# variable
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:44: an element of ListPage.Posts has no field or method "Titel"
  fix: did you mean "Title"?
  see: maago doc template

# map element
blog/templates/detail_page.html:1:16: DetailPage.Post.Meta.k has no field or method "X"
  fix: check the name
  see: maago doc template

# pointer field
blog/templates/detail_page.html:1:16: DetailPage.Post.Author has no field or method "Nme"
  fix: did you mean "Name"?
  see: maago doc template

# pointer receiver
blog/templates/detail_page.html:1:9: method PtrMethod of DetailPage.Post has a pointer receiver, which templates cannot call here: the value is the page, a map element or a result, not addressable
  fix: give PtrMethod a value receiver
  see: maago doc template

# method with arguments
blog/templates/detail_page.html:1:3: method called with arguments, which maago cannot check
  fix: compute the value into a field of the page struct, or into a method without arguments
  see: maago doc template

# piped into a method
blog/templates/detail_page.html:1:17: method called with arguments, which maago cannot check
  fix: compute the value into a field of the page struct, or into a method without arguments
  see: maago doc template

# assigned
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:69: an element of ListPage.Posts has no field or method "Titel"
  fix: did you mean "Title"?
  see: maago doc template

# unexported
blog/templates/detail_page.html:1:9: DetailPage.Post.secret is not exported, so templates cannot read it
  fix: export it: Secret
  see: maago doc template

# with
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:19: ListPage.Posts has no field or method "Count"
  fix: check the name
  see: maago doc template

# template with a value
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:18: ListPage.Count has no field or method "X"
  fix: check the name
  see: maago doc template

# template without a value
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:18: cannot read .Count: {{template}} called this template without a value, so its dot is nil
  fix: pass the value: {{template "name" .}}
  see: maago doc template

# after index
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:20: cannot check .Title: the result of index has no type maago can know
  fix: compute the value into a field of the page struct
  see: maago doc template

# an interface
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:8: cannot check .X: ListPage.Any is an interface, whose value has no type maago can know
  fix: give the page a field of a concrete type
  see: maago doc template

# an argument
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:16: ListPage has no field or method "Cont"
  fix: did you mean "Count"?
  see: maago doc template
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:28: ListPage has no field or method "Nme"
  fix: did you mean "Name"?
  see: maago doc template

# range over an int
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:20: an element of ListPage.Count has no field or method "X"
  fix: check the name
  see: maago doc template

# range over a map
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:33: an element of ListPage.ByName has no field or method "Titel"
  fix: did you mean "Title"?
  see: maago doc template

# range over an iterator
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:30: an element of ListPage.All has no field or method "Titel"
  fix: did you mean "Title"?
  see: maago doc template

# iterator of two, one variable
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:26: an element of ListPage.All has no field or method "Title"
  fix: check the name
  see: maago doc template
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:36: an element of ListPage.All has no field or method "Title"
  fix: check the name
  see: maago doc template

# int with two variables
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:9: cannot range over ListPage.Count of type int, with two variables
  fix: range over it with one variable
  see: maago doc template

# named map key
blog/templates/detail_page.html:1:10: cannot read .x of DetailPage.ByKey: its keys are Key, not string
  fix: give the map string keys
  see: maago doc template

# method past two pointers
blog/templates/detail_page.html:1:7: DetailPage.PP has no field or method "Excerpt"
  fix: check the name
  see: maago doc template

# range over a string
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:9: cannot range over ListPage.Name of type string
  fix: range over a slice, an array, a map, a channel, an int or an iterator
  see: maago doc template

# no template
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:12: no template "nope"
  fix: define it with {{define "nope"}}, or name one the set has
  see: maago doc template

# date
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:8: the layout of date is not a string literal
  fix: write it in quotes: {{date "2006-01-02" .CreatedAt}}
  see: maago doc template
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:33: date shows a time.Time, not int
  fix: pass a time.Time or *time.Time
  see: maago doc template
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:43: date takes a layout and a time, not 1 values
  fix: write {{date "2006-01-02 15:04" .CreatedAt}}
  see: maago doc template

# unknown function
blog/templates/list_page.html:1: function "nope" not defined
  fix: fix the template; it is Go's html/template
  see: maago doc template

# url name
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:7: unknown route name "post_detial"
  fix: did you mean "post_detail"? routes are declared in the apps' var Routes
  see: maago doc template

# url values
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:3: route post_detail has 1 wildcards, but url got 0 values
  fix: give one value for each {wildcard} of its path, in order
  see: maago doc template
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:42: {id} of route post_detail is int64, not a string constant
  fix: pass a value of type int64
  see: maago doc template
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:53: cannot check url: the route name is not a string literal
  fix: write the name in quotes: {{url "post_detail" .ID}}
  see: maago doc template
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:75: {tag} of route feed is string or int, not time.Time
  fix: pass a value of type string or int
  see: maago doc template

# no block
blog/urls.go:13:40: template blog/templates/list_page.html has no block "rows"
  fix: name a {{block}} or {{define}} of the page or of base.html
  see: maago doc template

# block of a handler
blog/urls.go:15:2: route feed renders a block, but its view returns no page
  fix: remove maago.Block
  see: maago doc view

# escaping
blog/templates/detail_page.html: ends in a non-text context
  fix: see html/template's escaping rules: an action cannot sit where the HTML cannot hold it
  see: maago doc template

# walked before executed
blog/templates/detail_page.html:1:18: DetailPage.Post has no field or method "Titel"
  fix: did you mean "Title"?
  see: maago doc template

# a block that does not escape alone
blog/templates/list_page.html: block rows, sent alone, ends in a non-text context
  fix: see html/template's escaping rules: an action cannot sit where the HTML cannot hold it
  see: maago doc template

# outside define with a layout
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:1: content outside {{define}} is never rendered: pages render through base.html
  fix: put it in a {{define}} of a block that base.html renders, such as {{define "content"}}
  see: maago doc template

# only defines without a layout
blog/templates/detail_page.html: page renders nothing: without base.html the file itself is the page
  fix: write the page outside the {{define}}s, or add templates/base.html
  see: maago doc template

# escaping in a page under a layout
blog/templates/list_page.html:2:6: {{if}} branches end in different contexts
  fix: see html/template's escaping rules: an action cannot sit where the HTML cannot hold it
  see: maago doc template

# a block with the page as its dot
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:52: cannot range over ListPage of type ListPage
  fix: range over a slice, an array, a map, a channel, an int or an iterator
  see: maago doc template

# a block only a route renders
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:31: ListPage has no field or method "Nope"
  fix: did you mean "Name"?
  see: maago doc template

# a directory
blog/templates/sub: directory in templates/
  fix: keep the templates in templates/ itself
  see: maago doc template

# an app without pages
blog/templates/detail_page.html: template of an app without HTML pages
  fix: remove it; only a view that returns a page renders a template
  see: maago doc template
blog/templates/list_page.html: template of an app without HTML pages
  fix: remove it; only a view that returns a page renders a template
  see: maago doc template

# range over an interface
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:9: cannot check what range ranges over: ListPage.Any is an interface, whose value has no type maago can know
  fix: give the page a field of a concrete type
  see: maago doc template

# a name of no case
blog/templates/detail_page.html:1:9: DetailPage.Post.제목 is not exported, so templates cannot read it
  fix: rename it to start with an upper-case letter
  see: maago doc template

# a file of no page and a field
blog/templates/detail_page.html:1:9: DetailPage.Post has no field or method "Titel"
  fix: did you mean "Title"?
  see: maago doc template
blog/templates/extra.html: template extra.html is no page's and not base.html
  fix: name it after a page type (PostPage → post_page.html), or move what it holds into a {{define}} of base.html
  see: maago doc template

# a file of no page
blog/templates/extra.html: template extra.html is no page's and not base.html
  fix: name it after a page type (PostPage → post_page.html), or move what it holds into a {{define}} of base.html
  see: maago doc template

# two files, two errors
blog/templates/detail_page.html:1:13: DetailPage.Post has no field or method "Titel"
  fix: did you mean "Title"?
  see: maago doc template
blog/templates/list_page.html:1:7: unknown route name "post_detial"
  fix: did you mean "post_detail"? routes are declared in the apps' var Routes
  see: maago doc template

